From e36c775e7fb36b50ecd0e7c13ff92bb31895667b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:45:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] governance: require a quantity kind when a parameter is
 defined [2026-11-13 03:45]

Pilot of T-020 stacked on T-010. Migration 126: base_quantity_kinds (six kinds seeded from the OD-24 delegated resolution) and base_parameters.quantity_kind (nullable FK). db.py add-parameter requires --quantity-kind (refuses naming the kinds); add-quantity-kind adds a kind with a ledger pointer. T-010 stop-gap (NON_QUANTITY_DOMAINS, its refusal, fixture filter, comment, AP1-AP5) deleted. Callers: test_scan_contract, test_db_amend_writers (pass a kind), test_evidence_cell_state_2_3 (FK parent in fixture), assess_cell and research_batch_dod messages, machines.yaml, stage-map.yaml, context-map.yaml.
